  "question": {
    "text": "The sum of the series <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math> upto <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>11</mn><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math> term is:"
